---
const experiences = [
  { name: "Paper", icon: "fa-regular fa-file-lines", color: "text-blue-400" },
  { name: "Forge", icon: "fa-solid fa-fire", color: "text-orange-500" },
  { name: "Fabric", icon: "fa-solid fa-scroll", color: "text-yellow-100" },
  { name: "Vanilla", icon: "fa-solid fa-cube", color: "text-green-400" },
  { name: "Modpacks", icon: "fa-solid fa-cubes-stacked", color: "text-purple-400" },
  { name: "Plugins", icon: "fa-solid fa-puzzle-piece", color: "text-pink-400" }
];
---

<section class="py-24 relative z-10 bg-[#060606]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-4">Instala cualquier experiencia</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-xl mx-auto">Ya sea que prefieras una experiencia Vanilla pura o cientos de mods, instálalo en un solo clic desde nuestro panel.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4">
      {experiences.map((exp) => (
        <div class="glass-card border border-white/5 p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors cursor-pointer group rounded-lg">
          <i class={`${exp.icon} text-3xl mb-4 opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-110 transition-all ${exp.color}`}></i>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-white">{exp.name}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
